Xbox 360: with the GX core on a render thread (SMS_XE_GX_THREAD=1, xenon/gx/xe_gx_queue.cpp), the write-gather pipe's buffer belongs to the game thread, which collects its bytes for the queue, and the core keeps a buffer of its own; the game's GXPC_ memory and byte-order entry points move to xe_gx_queue.cpp. Applied by xenon/tools/xstage to the staged copy only.
